  {
   "id": 677190,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "In sustainable marketing, companies innovate now and do which of the following for the future?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1346011,
     "content_html": "Earn money",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "That&#8217;s not correct. Earning money is important for a business, but sustainable marketing seeks to create a more viable future."
    },
    {
     "id": 1346012,
     "content_html": "Ensure viability",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "Sustainable marketing innovates now while ensuring a viable future."
    },
    {
     "id": 1346010,
     "content_html": "Save money",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "That&#8217;s not correct. Saving money may be a benefit of innovation."
    },
    {
     "id": 1346009,
     "content_html": "Earn profits",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "That&#8217;s not correct. Profitability is important, but it is not a future-oriented achievement."
    }
   ],
